      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 5.85,
          "en": "-: In the last lecture, we started adding our child routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.85,
          "end": 8.13,
          "en": "and now loading the recipe detail component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.13,
          "end": 9.78,
          "en": "doesn't work anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.78,
          "end": 10.89,
          "en": "The reason for this is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.89,
          "end": 14.07,
          "en": "that here we use recipe all over the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.07,
          "end": 16.26,
          "en": "and that's a property of this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.26,
          "end": 19.5,
          "en": "but it's a property set through property binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.5,
          "end": 21.03,
          "en": "with @input in front of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.03,
          "end": 25.38,
          "en": "So it awaits to be set from outside the component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.38,
          "end": 27.51,
          "en": "Since this component is set through routing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.51,
          "end": 30.18,
          "en": "though, this won't work anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.18,
          "end": 33.45,
          "en": "So we have to change how we receive the recipe here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "how we set the recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 37.987,
          "en": "and we can change it because keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.987,
          "end": 41.94,
          "en": "in our route, which we define here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 45.39,
          "en": "we passed this ID, which is a dynamic parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.39,
          "end": 49.86,
          "en": "So we should be able to load a recipe by the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.86,
          "end": 52.56,
          "en": "which will simply refer to the position",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.56,
          "end": 55.41,
          "en": "in the array of recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.41,
          "end": 57.33,
          "en": "So here is your challenge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.33,
          "end": 60.57,
          "en": "Try fixing the recipe detail component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.57,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "to somehow use that ID to update the recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 68.7,
          "en": "which is displayed to fetch it from the recipe service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.7,
          "end": 70.74,
          "en": "Of course, you will need to implement some method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.74,
          "end": 73.95,
          "en": "in the recipe service, which allows you to get that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.95,
          "end": 76.41,
          "en": "Here is your chance to pause the video.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 79.533,
          "en": "Thereafter, I will solve it together with you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.28,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "So, were you successful?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 87.09,
          "en": "Let's fix it together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.09,
          "end": 88.86,
          "en": "In the recipe detail component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.86,
          "end": 90.93,
          "en": "we clearly can remove @input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.93,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "because that's not how we receive the value anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 96.83500000000001,
          "en": "So we can also remove the import of @input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.83500000000001,
          "end": 99.66,
          "en": "That of course also means, before we forget it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.66,
          "end": 102.66,
          "en": "that in the recipe item component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.66,
          "end": 106.17,
          "en": "we can remove the on selected click listener here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.17,
          "end": 110.16,
          "en": "because that will not be how we pass the value anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.16,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "And of course we could also remove the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 113.75999999999999,
          "en": "on selected method here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.75999999999999,
          "end": 116.13,
          "en": "That is something we don't need anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.13,
          "end": 117.47999999999999,
          "en": "Of course, that also allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.47999999999999,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "to remove the recipes service from this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 121.23,
          "en": "and remove the import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.23,
          "end": 123.75,
          "en": "So we're cleaning up quite a lot here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.75,
          "end": 125.76,
          "en": "In the recipe list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.76,
          "end": 127.71,
          "en": "we don't have to change anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 130.35,
          "en": "And in the recipe component itself here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 130.35,
          "end": 133.89,
          "en": "we already did make a change and add the router outlet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.89,
          "end": 135.75,
          "en": "So now in the recipe detail component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.75,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "we somehow need to get our single recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 142.35,
          "en": "and we know that we will get the ID from the router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.35,
          "end": 144.57,
          "en": "So let's first fetch this ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 144.57,
          "end": 147.75,
          "en": "and you learned that for this we need to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.75,
          "end": 149.61,
          "en": "to the activated route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.61,
          "end": 153.78,
          "en": "So let's inject it here, of type activated route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.78,
          "end": 158.78,
          "en": "Make sure to add this import here from @angular router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.15,
          "end": 162.39,
          "en": "This import is important to enable type script",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 162.39,
          "end": 164.79,
          "en": "to identify the type you're trying to inject here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 164.79,
          "end": 167.31,
          "en": "And if that angular is able to use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.31,
          "end": 169.82999999999998,
          "en": "So now we get this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 169.82999999999998,
          "end": 173.52,
          "en": "and now we have two ways of retrieving the id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 178.52,
          "en": "The first one would be to simply bind it to route, snap,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 179.31,
          "end": 184.31,
          "en": "excuse me, this, route, snapshot, params, id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.77,
          "end": 189.03,
          "en": "But this will only work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 189.03,
          "end": 192.15,
          "en": "for the first time we load a detail component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 192.15,
          "end": 193.47,
          "en": "Now keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.47,
          "end": 197.25,
          "en": "the menu where we can click on one is on the left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.25,
          "end": 200.25,
          "en": "So we will be able to choose a new recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.25,
          "end": 203.79,
          "en": "whilst we still see the details of another one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 203.79,
          "end": 207.96,
          "en": "So we probably want to react to changes in our recipe ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 207.96,
          "end": 210.75,
          "en": "because that's absolutely possible in our app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 210.75,
          "end": 213.58100000000002,
          "en": "So that is not the approach I want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.58100000000002,
          "end": 215.88,
          "en": "Instead, what I want to do is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.88,
          "end": 217.47,
          "en": "I want to use my route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 217.47,
          "end": 219.27,
          "en": "the params observable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 219.27,
          "end": 221.73,
          "en": "and subscribe to that observable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 221.73,
          "end": 224.28,
          "en": "Now with that, we can react to any changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.28,
          "end": 225.99,
          "en": "in our route params",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 225.99,
          "end": 228.69,
          "en": "and we will get them here of type params,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 228.69,
          "end": 232.65,
          "en": "as we learned, to be imported from at Angular router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 232.65,
          "end": 237.65,
          "en": "And now, now we can really react to a new ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 238.14,
          "end": 241.35,
          "en": "So we should probably store that ID here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.35,
          "end": 243.21,
          "en": "in a property of our class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 243.21,
          "end": 245.37,
          "en": "It will be of type number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 245.37,
          "end": 250.37,
          "en": "So we should set this ID equal to parents' ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 250.86,
          "end": 255.09,
          "en": "though we know that what we get back here will be a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 255.09,
          "end": 257.01,
          "en": "So we should cast it to a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 257.01,
          "end": 259.23,
          "en": "by adding a plus in front of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 259.23,
          "end": 263.43,
          "en": "So now we will have an ID in the form of a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 263.43,
          "end": 266.94,
          "en": "which we can use to identify our recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 266.94,
          "end": 269.76,
          "en": "Well with this information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 269.76,
          "end": 272.79,
          "en": "we want to load our recipe from the recipe service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 272.79,
          "end": 273.623,
          "en": "and forward it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 273.623,
          "end": 275.46,
          "en": "We need to change our recipe service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 275.46,
          "end": 277.86,
          "en": "because right now we got no way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 277.86,
          "end": 280.95,
          "en": "of loading a single recipe by ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 280.95,
          "end": 283.68,
          "en": "That's something we can easily implement though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.68,
          "end": 287.01,
          "en": "We can simply implement a get recipe method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 287.01,
          "end": 290.34000000000003,
          "en": "which takes an ID of type number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 290.34000000000003,
          "end": 293.88,
          "en": "And then we can simply return this recipes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 293.88,
          "end": 297,
          "en": "and select the item at this index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 297,
          "end": 298.89,
          "en": "We could also rename ID to index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 298.89,
          "end": 302.583,
          "en": "to make really clear what that number will be in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 303.42,
          "end": 307.02,
          "en": "You could also call slice before doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 307.02,
          "end": 311.34,
          "en": "Because slice would now give you a copy of your array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.34,
          "end": 314.19,
          "en": "though it won't be a deep copy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 314.19,
          "end": 317.34,
          "en": "So the objects still are the same anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 317.34,
          "end": 320.7,
          "en": "So you can also directly return the object like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 320.7,
          "end": 323.16,
          "en": "You could of course also create a hard copy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 323.16,
          "end": 326.61,
          "en": "of that object with object assigned, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 326.61,
          "end": 327.99,
          "en": "That's not what I want to do here though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 327.99,
          "end": 329.932,
          "en": "So we return a single recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 329.932,
          "end": 334.53,
          "en": "now back in the recipe detail component type script file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 334.53,
          "end": 337.17,
          "en": "After fetching an ID and storing it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 337.17,
          "end": 340.23,
          "en": "I want to fetch the new recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 340.23,
          "end": 343.59000000000003,
          "en": "and I will later also show why I needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 343.59000000000003,
          "end": 345.63,
          "en": "to store the ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 345.63,
          "end": 349.47,
          "en": "So let's fetch the recipe using our recipe service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 349.47,
          "end": 351.45,
          "en": "Whenever the ID changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 351.45,
          "end": 353.67,
          "en": "then I will call get recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 353.67,
          "end": 356.79,
          "en": "and pass my ID as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 356.79,
          "end": 358.74,
          "en": "And with that, we should be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 358.74,
          "end": 363.03,
          "en": "to indeed make our application to work again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 363.03,
          "end": 366.63,
          "en": "by going manually to recipes zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 366.63,
          "end": 369.27,
          "en": "We indeed see the detail view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 369.27,
          "end": 371.01,
          "en": "for the schnitzel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 371.01,
          "end": 373.32,
          "en": "and with one for the burger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 373.32,
          "end": 374.82,
          "en": "So that is working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 374.82,
          "end": 377.82,
          "en": "Now, we also need to enable these links here to work again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 377.82,
          "end": 379.97,
          "en": "Cause right now they're not doing anything.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
